# A blocked Prodigal Sorcerer deals noncombat damage to another creature. The Wall does not
# protect that creature, but still prevents the Sorcerer’s combat damage to itself (CR 615.1).
[Bot1 Deck]
Wall of Vapor
Memnite
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Quirion Ranger
Prodigal Sorcerer
Black Lotus
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wall of Vapor.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Quirion Ranger.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
